|------|----------|----------------|-------------------|
| Plaintext secrets in `.env` | 🔴 CRITICAL | Not loaded by app | Use AWS Secrets Manager or Vault |
| Git exposure | 🔴 CRITICAL | `.env.test` visible | Add to `.gitignore`, use signed commits |
| Container image exposure | 🔴 CRITICAL | Not an issue yet | Never COPY .env into images |
| Log leakage | 🟠 HIGH | No logging implemented yet | Implement secret redaction |
| Memory inspection | 🟠 HIGH | Secrets in process.env | Minimize secret lifetime in memory |
| No secret rotation | 🟡 MEDIUM | No rotation implemented | Implement automated rotation (24h) |
| No audit trail | 🟡 MEDIUM | No logging implemented | Log all secret access |

---

