## 📝 DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST

- [ ] Enable HTTPS/TLS (use reverse proxy like Nginx)
- [ ] Set `NODE_ENV=production`
- [ ] Generate JWT_SECRET and store in secrets manager (not .env)
- [ ] Configure rate limiting thresholds based on expected traffic
- [ ] Set up request/response logging to centralized service
- [ ] Implement monitoring and alerting for security events
- [ ] Add authentication mechanism (OAuth2, API keys, etc.)
- [ ] Regular dependency updates: `npm audit fix`
- [ ] Security testing: OWASP ZAP, Burp Suite
- [ ] Add unit/integration tests for security controls

