| 1 | No Authentication/Authorization | 🔴 CRITICAL | Access Control | Not Addressed |
| 2 | No Input Validation | 🟠 HIGH | Injection | Not Addressed |
| 3 | Missing Security Headers | 🟠 HIGH | Misconfiguration | Not Addressed |
| 4 | No CORS Configuration | 🟠 HIGH | Misconfiguration | Not Addressed |
| 5 | No Rate Limiting | 🟡 MEDIUM | DoS Protection | Not Addressed |
| 6 | No Error Handling | 🟡 MEDIUM | Information Disclosure | Not Addressed |
| 7 | No Environment Config | 🟡 MEDIUM | Misconfiguration | Not Addressed |
| 8 | No Dependency Scanning | 🟡 MEDIUM | Vulnerable Components | Not Addressed |
| 9 | No HTTPS Enforcement | 🟢 LOW | Transport Security | Not Addressed |

