## Remediation Priority

| Priority | Issue | Category |
|----------|-------|----------|
| 🔴 CRITICAL | No Authentication | A05 |
| 🔴 CRITICAL | Broken Access Control | A01 |
| 🔴 CRITICAL | No HTTPS/TLS | Infrastructure |
