✗ DO NOT commit any files containing API keys or secrets
✓ Use .gitignore to exclude .env, .env.*, and other secret files
✓ Use environment variable management systems (AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault, etc.)
✓ Rotate any exposed real credentials immediately
```

